    {
      "id": "claim_a7659b8f7a214da19dd46024667c6732",
      "statement": "Almost every product model carries an `org` ForeignKey to Org with on_delete=CASCADE (OrgUser, OrgWarehouse, OrgPrefectBlockv1, OrgDataFlowv1, OrgTask, SyncStats, Chart, Dashboard, Metric, KPI, Alert, ReportSnapshot, ResourceShare, etc.), with one-to-one satellites (OrgPlans, OrgPreferences, OrgSupersets, OrgWren). Exceptions: OrgDbt has no org field (Org.dbt points at it with SET_NULL), Task and Role/Permission are global, Notification reaches the org only via OrgUser, OrgFeatureFlag.org is nullable for global flags, and OrgUser.org is nullable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/ddpui/models/notifications.py#L1-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5606696917f76cbdd279eeb3c098b8a536ff70a685775213d586d38dfab7ee5d:"
