      "id": "claim_2755876201884da78d236b86d1c9cdfe",
      "statement": "Cross-entity analytics links are soft: Dashboard stores a tabs JSON whose components reference chart and KPI ids (walked by Dashboard.component_ids), Chart keeps its data binding as schema_name, table_name and extra_config JSON, and ResourceShare points at resources with resource_type plus a string resource_id rather than an FK. The database therefore does not enforce or cascade these references.",
