      "statement": "ReportSnapshot has no FK to Dashboard or Chart; it stores frozen_dashboard and frozen_chart_configs JSON plus period_start, period_end and date_column, so deleting the source dashboard or charts does not affect snapshots. It has its own unique public_share_token separate from Dashboard's.",
